dialect protocol
protocol 2d.spr
version 1
schema puzzle.2d.fixture.mutation
start record
framing record
record puzzle.2d-add-vertex tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record puzzle.2d-set-face tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record puzzle.2d-transform-mesh tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
